## Java runtime dependencies

The plugin has **zero runtime dependencies** beyond the JDK. HTTP and
WebSocket communication use `java.net.http`, which is part of the Java
standard library. Test-only dependencies (JUnit 5, AssertJ, Awaitility,
Java-WebSocket) are used exclusively for the test suite and are not shipped
in the release JAR.

